---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Resume" description="소개와 대회 수상, 교육 및 활동 이력을 담은 이력서입니다.">
  <div class="resume shell">
    <header class="resume-header">
      <div class="resume-identity">
        <img class="resume-avatar" src="/favicon.png" width="104" height="104" alt="" />
        <div>
          <h1>김건우</h1>
          <p>Wooung</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <dl class="resume-links">
        <div><dt>GitHub</dt><dd><a href="https://github.com/wooung105" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">wooung105 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (새 창에서 열림)</span></a></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </header>

    <section class="resume-section" aria-labelledby="summary-title">
      <h2 id="summary-title"><span>S</span>ummary</h2>
      <div class="resume-content">
        <h3>클라우드 환경을 중심으로 보안 취약점과 공격 기법을 공부하고 있습니다.</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>새로운 침투 경로를 설계하고 검증하는 데 관심이 있습니다.</li>
          <li>학습하며 마주한 문제와 해결 과정, 새롭게 배운 것을 블로그에 기록합니다.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="resume-section" aria-labelledby="project-title">
      <h2 id="project-title"><span>P</span>roject</h2>
    </section>

    <section class="resume-section" aria-labelledby="award-title">
      <h2 id="award-title"><span>A</span>ward</h2>
      <div class="resume-content">
        <table class="resume-awards" aria-labelledby="award-title">
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">연도</th><th scope="col">대회</th><th scope="col">수상</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>2025</td><td>전국기능경기대회 보안부문</td><td>장려상</td></tr>
            <tr><td>2025</td><td>경기도 기능경기대회 보안부문</td><td>은상</td></tr>
            <tr><td>2024</td><td>경운대학교 지능형 모빌리티 SW 경진대회 보안부문</td><td>대상</td></tr>
            <tr><td>2024</td><td>경기도 기능경기대회 보안부문</td><td>동상</td></tr>
            <tr><td>2023</td><td>경운대학교 지능형 모빌리티 SW 경진대회 보안부문</td><td>금상</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="resume-section" aria-labelledby="education-title">
      <h2 id="education-title"><span>E</span>ducation</h2>
      <article class="resume-content resume-entry">
        <div class="resume-entry-heading"><h3>고려대학교(세종)</h3><p class="resume-period"><time datetime="2026-03">2026.03</time> – 현재</p></div>
        <p class="resume-description">인공지능사이버보안학과</p>
        <ul><li>KUality <span class="resume-period">· <time datetime="2026-03">2026.03</time> – 현재</span></li></ul>
      </article>
      <article class="resume-content resume-entry">
        <div class="resume-entry-heading"><h3>한봄고등학교</h3><p class="resume-period"><time datetime="2023-03">2023.03</time> – <time datetime="2026-02">2026.02</time></p></div>
        <p class="resume-description">빅데이터정보과</p>
        <ul><li>Semgle 사이버보안팀 <span class="resume-period">· <time datetime="2023-04">2023.04</time> – <time datetime="2026-02">2026.02</time></span></li></ul>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="resume-section" aria-labelledby="activity-title">
      <h2 id="activity-title"><span>A</span>ctivity</h2>
      <article class="resume-content resume-entry">
        <div class="resume-entry-heading"><h3>화이트햇스쿨 4기</h3><p class="resume-period"><time datetime="2026-06">2026.06</time> – 현재</p></div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .resume{padding-top:38px;padding-bottom:100px}
  .resume-header{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:42px}
  .resume-identity{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px}
  .resume-avatar{display:block;width:clamp(80px,8vw,104px);height:clamp(80px,8vw,104px);object-fit:cover;border-radius:50%;background:#fff}
  .resume-identity h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.04em}
  .resume-identity p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}
  .resume-links{display:grid;gap:7px;margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px}
  .resume-links div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:58px 1fr;gap:8px}
  .resume-links dt{font-weight:700}
  .resume-links dd{margin:0}
  .resume-links a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .resume-section{margin-top:32px}
  .resume-section h2{margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:8px;font-size:clamp(24px,2.5vw,30px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.03em}
  .resume-section h2 span{color:var(--accent)}
  .resume-content{padding-top:18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8}
  .resume-content h3{margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .resume-content ul{margin:10px 0 0;padding-left:20px}
  .resume-content li+li{margin-top:4px}
  .resume-description{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}
  .resume-description{margin:3px 0 8px}
  .resume-entry+.resume-entry{margin-top:12px}
  .resume-entry-heading{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:4px 20px}
  .resume-period{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap}
  .resume-awards{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;text-align:left;font-size:14px}
  .resume-awards th,.resume-awards td{padding:9px 12px 9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .resume-awards th{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-weight:600}
  .resume-awards th:first-child{width:72px}
  .resume-awards th:last-child{width:52px}
  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}
  @media(max-width:600px){.resume{padding-top:30px;padding-bottom:70px}.resume-header{gap:20px;margin-bottom:34px}.resume-links{width:100%;margin:0}.resume-section{margin-top:28px}}
</style>
